etry > should call trace when extending locks 302ms\n ✓ tests/job.redis.test.ts > Job (redis-only) > .remove > removes processed hash 16ms\n ✓ tests/job.redis.test.ts > Job (redis-only) > .moveToCompleted > should not fail if queue meta key is missing 3ms\n ✓ tests/job.redis.test.ts > Job (redis-only) > .moveToCompleted > should not complete a parent job before its children 8ms\n ✓ tests/job.redis.test.ts > Job (redis-only) > .moveToFailed > when job is removed > should not save stacktrace 112ms\n\n Test Files  7 passed (7)\n      Tests  268 passed (268)\n   Start at  00:43:13\n   Duration  126.10s (transform 251ms, setup 142ms, import 577ms, tests 124.91s, environment 0ms)\n\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"node node_modules/vitest/vitest.mjs run --no-file-parallelism tests/worker.test.ts tests/job.test.ts tests/worker.redis.test.ts tests/concurrency.test.ts tests/stalled_jobs.test.ts tests/lock_manager.test.ts tests/job.redis.test.ts","time":{"start":1789792993411,"end":1789793119670}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03f4c193f7a0daab016aae12e0b02c87d1a0dd1f15aea64713"}},"id":"prt_0b7f9be06001pZ5WB4Qzw4gnll","sessionID":"ses_f48092514ffeIZb8Fwe8NLemBP","messageID":"msg_0b7f9b190001w7NSf5NwaaQ1vN"}}
