{"type":"text","timestamp":1789793124201,"sessionID":"ses_f48092514ffeIZb8Fwe8NLemBP","part":{"id":"prt_0b7fbb9af001L3Lml7o3rKDhf4","messageID":"msg_0b7fbadff001GTaVpQDZFtxDzC","sessionID":"ses_f48092514ffeIZb8Fwe8NLemBP","type":"text","text":"The build and all 268 tests in the supplied regression command passed, including recovery, retry limits, fixed backoff, and stolen-lock handling. The five new regression tests also passed: they verify stale operations leave persisted state and events unchanged, while the replacement owner can renew and complete the job.","time":{"start":1789793122735,"end":1789793124198},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0096d4b8f5560a59016aae1362b45487d1be250976398a9f50","phase":"commentary"}}}}
